*.egg-info/
# Local-only names that must never be committed, at any depth: the audit
# report and the app's own workspace dir (AGENTS.md; guarded by
# tests/test_containment.py). Unanchored on purpose — a root-anchored
# pattern lets a nested copy slip through.
stella_workspace/
SECURITY-AUDIT.md
# The development tree's own copy of Stella's state (data dir, config dir and
# voice socket), written by bin/stella-dev. Never the owner's real state,
# which stays under ~/.local/share/stella and ~/.config/stella.
.dev/
